# Reaches Rebel's floor over the platform layer's streams, `hero_stream.h`, so
# that `heroes test` on this file runs the floor's own tests (spec § 12, § 13).
# It prints whether the process has a standard output the layer can hand out
# as a stream, which is the same line on every run that prints at all.

use <rebel>/io/hero_stream

function main()
    print(hero_stream.std(1) != nullptr)
